- V. WS-4..WS-9 alignment eval suites — DONE: `evals/metrics.py` and `evals/run.py` provide preference, hallucination, safety, helpfulness, Bangla-quality, and refusal metrics/controls; all six suites are included in `make eval-alignment`. WS-7/WS-8 deterministic proxy metrics and suites are covered by `tests/test_alignment_quality_suites.py`; preference data and tests remain in `data/benchmarks/preference/v1/` and `tests/test_preference_suites.py`. Remaining: real-model baselines, linguistic review for Bangla grammar/register/transliteration, RM-guided win-rate replacing the rule-based judge, then scale & eval (long-context, multi-GPU) per `docs/pretraining-plan.md`.

