Production Model Family — WS-1/WS-3/WS-5 scaffolding complete (commit c2ad2bb+)

- [x] WS-1 tier configs + registry + `make config-validate` — all four tier configs load and validate; `ModelTier` resolves config path to digest; registry lists all four tiers with accurate metadata.
- [x] WS-2 MoE research track — `ml/models/moe/train.py` (`MoETrainer` with separate LR for MoE params + auxiliary loss) + `make moe-smoke`; `ml/inference/moe_engine.py` (`MoEEngine` with `build_routing_table`, `expert_parallel_batch`, hidden-state `generate`) + `ml/inference/expert_parallel.py` (`ExpertParallelBatcher`); `ml/models/moe/decision.md` records the architecture decision; tests `tests/test_moe_train.py`, `tests/test_moe_engine.py`.
- [x] WS-3 reasoning/coding specialist SFT — `ml/sft/reasoning.py` and `ml/sft/coding.py` dataset loaders with family annotation; `ml/tokenizer/coding.py` additive coding special-token extensions; `evals/suites/reasoning.yaml`, `evals/suites/coding.yaml`, `evals/suites/multimodal.yaml`; `make eval-reasoning`, `make eval-coding`, `make eval-routing`, `make eval-regress`, `make eval-all` wired.
- [x] WS-4 multimodal pipelines — `ml/sft/mm_dataset.py` (`MultimodalDataset` + `load_mm_records`, groups by image/audio/document/text); `evals/suites/multimodal.yaml`; tests `tests/test_mm_dataset.py`.
- [x] WS-5 model routing wired into the API — `ml/inference/router_config.yaml` (task-class → tier, escalation chain, tier quality, latency SLA); `ModelRouter` loads the YAML and escalates on quality-floor miss; `services/api/router.py` + `services/api/api/routers/chat.py` expose the `X-Kotha-Tier` header (`auto`/`nano`/`small`/`medium`/`large`); routing decision is returned in the `X-Kotha-Routing` response header.
- [x] WS-1/WS-2/WS-3/WS-4/WS-5 tests — `tests/test_model_tier.py`, `tests/test_tier_configs.py`, `tests/test_reasoning_head.py`, `tests/test_coding_tokens.py`, `tests/test_model_router.py`, `tests/test_moe_train.py`, `tests/test_moe_engine.py`, `tests/test_mm_dataset.py`, `tests/test_coding_eval.py`; `make plans-check` clean.

Remaining: real per-tier model artifacts and all-tier model validation; MoE quality/compute comparisons at a fixed parameter budget (Phase A); static routing table + expert parallelism production integration (Phase C); frontier MoE config + trained checkpoint (Phase D); tier-specific SFT; production multimodal backbones/integration.
